  "blocks": [
    {
      "kind": "heading",
      "level": 1,
      "text": "Addenda and Errata"
    },
    {
      "kind": "text",
      "text": "The following is an inventory of critical additions and corrections to this calendar made after the initial publication date of February 27, 2026."
    },
    {
      "kind": "text",
      "text": "Changes that will affect a student's ability to complete their degree, such as changes to course requisites, course counts, program requirements, policy details, and deadline dates will be documented. Corrections to spelling, grammar, formatting, and so on will not be documented."
    },
    {
      "kind": "text",
      "text": "Date"
    },
    {
      "kind": "text",
      "text": "Addenda/Errata"
    },
    {
      "kind": "text",
      "text": "August 7, 2026"
    },
    {
      "kind": "text",
      "text": "The following page has been added to the calendar:"
    },
    {
      "kind": "text",
      "text": "UN Sustainable Development Goals",
      "links": [
        {
          "text": "UN Sustainable Development Goals",
          "url": "https://www.torontomu.ca/calendar/2026-2027/un-sustainable-development-goals/"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "text",
      "text": "August 6, 2026"
    },
    {
      "kind": "text",
      "text": "The Minor in Economics has been corrected to remove ENG 603 from the list of elective courses.",
      "links": [
        {
          "text": "Minor in Economics",
          "url": "https://www.torontomu.ca/calendar/2026-2027/minors/economics_minor/"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "text",
      "text": "July 28, 2026"
    },
    {
      "kind": "text",
      "text": "The Minor in Information Technology Management has been corrected to remove ITM 350 from the list of courses in \"Focus 3: Digital Transformation.\"",
      "links": [
        {
          "text": "Minor in Information Technology Management",
          "url": "https://www.torontomu.ca/calendar/2026-2027/minors/itm_minor/"
        },
        {
          "text": "ITM 350",
          "url": "https://www.torontomu.ca/calendar/2026-2027/courses/information-technology-management/ITM/350/"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "text",
      "text": "The Minor in Sociology has been corrected to remove SOC 302 from the list of elective courses.",
      "links": [
        {
          "text": "Minor in Sociology",
          "url": "https://www.torontomu.ca/calendar/2026-2027/minors/sociology_minor/"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "text",
      "text": "June 30, 2026"
    },
    {
      "kind": "text",
      "text": "The Child and Youth Care curriculum has been corrected. In the Full-Time, Four-Year Program for students admitted Fall 2026 and after , students take two open electives in 7th Semester. Previously, this had been listed as \"one open elective\" in error.",
      "links": [
        {
          "text": "Child and Youth Care",
          "url": "https://www.torontomu.ca/calendar/2026-2027/programs/community/child_youth/"
        },
        {
          "text": "Full-Time, Four-Year Program for students admitted Fall 2026 and after",
          "url": "https://www.torontomu.ca/calendar/2026-2027/programs/community/child_youth/"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "text",
      "text": "June 24, 2026"
    },
    {
      "kind": "text",
      "text": "The custom requisite of ACS 103 has been removed. Previously, the course was available only to students in Arts and Contemporary Studies.",
      "links": [
        {
          "text": "ACS 103",
          "url": "https://www.torontomu.ca/calendar/2026-2027/courses/arts-and-contemporary-studies/ACS/103/"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "text",
      "text": "June 22, 2026"
    },
    {
      "kind": "text",
      "text": "The contacts hours of CHE 402 and CHE 403 have been corrected. Previously, the courses had been listed as having 3 lecture hours and 3 tutorial hours. Each course has only 3 lecture hours.",
      "links": [
        {
          "text": "CHE 402",
          "url": "https://www.torontomu.ca/calendar/2026-2027/courses/chemical-engineering/CHE/402/"
        },
        {
          "text": "CHE 403",
          "url": "https://www.torontomu.ca/calendar/2026-2027/courses/chemical-engineering/CHE/403/"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "text",
      "text": "June 9, 2026"
    },
    {
      "kind": "text",
      "text": "The grading basis of CLD 251 has been revised. The course is now graded and is no longer pass/fail.",
      "links": [
        {
          "text": "CLD 251",
          "url": "https://www.torontomu.ca/calendar/2026-2027/courses/early-childhood-studies/CLD/251/"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "text",
      "text": "May 28, 2026"
    },
    {
      "kind": "text",
      "text": "SOC 221 has been corrected to include the following custom requisite: Not available to Sociology, Criminology-Sociology, History-Sociology and Politics and Governance-Sociology double major program students.",
      "links": [
        {
          "text": "SOC 221",
          "url": "https://www.torontomu.ca/calendar/2026-2027/courses/sociology/SOC/221/"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "text",
      "text": "May 25, 2026"
    },
    {
      "kind": "text",
      "text": "The following Significant Date has been revised:",
      "links": [
        {
          "text": "Significant Date",
          "url": "https://www.torontomu.ca/calendar/2026-2027/dates/"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "text",
      "text": "2026-08-05 to 2026-09-16: Fall Term Waitlist Period"
    },
    {
      "kind": "text",
      "text": "Previously, the end date had been listed as 2026-09-09 in error."
    },
    {
      "kind": "text",
      "text": "May 20, 2026"
    },
    {
      "kind": "text",
      "text": "The following Significant Dates have been revised:",
      "links": [
        {
          "text": "Significant Dates",
          "url": "https://www.torontomu.ca/calendar/2026-2027/dates/"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "text",
      "text": "2026-05-29: Last Day for Full Payment of Spring Session and Spring/Summer Term Undergraduate Course Fees"
    },
    {
      "kind": "text",
      "text": "2027-05-28: Last Day for Full Payment of Spring Session and Spring/Summer Term Undergraduate Course Fees"
    },
    {
      "kind": "text",
      "text": "Previously, the descriptions had stated that this deadline applied to Summer Session Undergraduate Course Fees in error."
    },
    {
      "kind": "text",
      "text": "The following Significant Date has been added:"
    },
    {
      "kind": "text",
      "text": "2026-06-26: Last Day for Full Payment of Summer Session Undergraduate Course Fees"
    },
    {
      "kind": "text",
      "text": "May 20, 2026"
    },
    {
      "kind": "text",
      "text": "On the New Media page, the titles of Option 2 and Option 3 in 6th Semester for students admitted Fall 2025 have been corrected. Previously, they had been listed as \"Art as Play\" and \"Video Games\" respectively.",
